WEBVTT

NOTE The Scarecrow (1920) - Riah TV captions

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.500
[music]

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.250
Slowly, majestically, the
sun steals over the hilltops.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.500
"All the rooms in this
house are in one room."

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.000
"I don't care how she
votes—I'm going to marry her!"

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:07.750
"Set the table."

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:44.250
"Hurry! My stomach's
as empty as a saloon!"

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:48.500
Stung by her father's treatment,
she planned to ruin his rural
stomach—so she baked him a cream
pie.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:36.750
She's in the Dancers' Union and
can't stop until the whistle
blows.

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:31.750
"This is so sudden."

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:33.750
"He's running away with
your horse to get married!"

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:29.000
"Where's the ring?"

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.000
"...I now pronounce you..."
